ct Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"67580798\"/></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">solar submersible pump DC brushless motor</span></strong></p><p><img alt=\"太阳能泵3\" src=\"/Content/upload/2019348866/201901121541284958617.jpg\"/></p><p>solar submersible pump DC brushless motor<span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></span> has 5 different models, suitable for lots of fields, where is lack of sunshine.Max head is 80 meters. Max flow rate is 5.8 m3/h. </p><p><br/></p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter (specification)</strong></p><p>Power: solar</p><p>Categories: submersible pump</p><p>Motor Material: oil filled, 100% Copper Wire</p><p>Pump body Material: stainless steel</p><p>Voltage: DC 24v/48v</p><p>Head max:80m</p><p>Max flow rate: 5.8m3/h</p><p>Maximum diameter: 95mm</p><p>Choice: with/ without control box. with/ without solar panel</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>2. Installation example</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"solar pump\" src=\"/Content/upload/2019348866/201901121548104671114.jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>3. </strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">Introduction of Functions</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">The controller could monitor the following conditions and start the automatic protection at meanwhile:</span></p><p style=\"margin-left:71px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 150%;\">Water shortage in the pump(External version)</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:71px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;\">O</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; line-height: 150%;\">verload or lock</span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 150%;\">ed-rotor in the pump</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:71px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 150%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">High input voltage</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:71px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 150%;\">Low input voltage</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:71px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 150%;\">Stator phase failure</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:71px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">6. </span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 150%;\">Short circuit</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:71px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">7. </span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 150%;\">Overheating</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:71px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">8. </span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 150%;\">Misconnection of the positive and negative pole</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong style=\"white-space: normal;\">4. </strong><strong style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">Applications</span></strong></span></p><p>Uses: domestic, civil, agricultural, industrial</p><p>Applications: home, irrigation , factory</p><p><img alt=\"image019(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231532518618815.jpg\"/></p><p style='margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 10px 0px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(141, 144, 149); font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, \"PingFang SC\", 微软雅黑, Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal;'><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">8. FAQ</strong></p><p style='margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 10px 0px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(141, 144, 149); font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, \"PingFang SC\", 微软雅黑, Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal;'><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">1. Q:Can you produce the pump with my own brand ?</strong></p><p style='margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 10px 0px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(141, 144, 149); font-family: \"Helvetica 